OL,3,GNEWSAMum 'lost trust' in surgeon review
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum whose daughter was among more
OL,7,Fthan 200 patients "harmed" after being
OL,8,Foperated on by a now-suspended NHS
OL,9,Fsurgeon says she has lost trust in the
OL,10,Fhospital that treated her.
OL,12,FOf the 209 patients who "experienced
OL,13,Fharm" under the care of orthopaedic
OL,14,Fsurgeon Kuldeep Stohr at Addenbrooke's
OL,15,FHospital in Cambridge, 41 were classed
OL,16,Fas severe and one person died, as first
OL,17,Freported by the BBC on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
