OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum 'lost trust' in surgeon review
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FLynn, whose 13-year-old daughter Tammy
OL,7,Fwas among the first to receive findings
OL,8,Ffrom an independent investigation last
OL,9,Fyear, said the number of patients
OL,10,Finvolved was "ridiculous".
OL,12,FThe hospital trust said it was "deeply
OL,13,Fsorry". Stohr previously said she was
OL,14,Ffully co-operating with an
OL,15,Finvestigation.
